---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../../../components/Sidebar.astro';
---

<Layout title="Organisation" lang="en" activePage="organisation" altLangHref="/organisatie/">
  <div class="page-intro">
    <h1>Organisation</h1>
    <div class="intro-images">
      <img src="/images/interimverkoper.jpg" alt="Interim seller" />
      <img src="/images/product-placement.jpg" alt="Product placement" />
      <img src="/images/oven-bakkerij1.jpg" alt="Bakery oven" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-area">
    <main class="main-content entry anim-up">
      <div class="breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/en/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Organisation</span>
      </div>

      <div class="colored-box">
        <p style="text-align:justify;">Pinso believes in the quality and originality of the product. Nevertheless employees are still the key factor in the entire process. Whether it comes to producing the product, verifying its quality after production, transportation or selling it. At least 60% of the entire process is carried out by employees. Success can only be achieved when production and workers are perfectly attuned to each other. For this purpose we developed together with our partners "PPI". Pinso helps you to integrate this methodology successful into your organization.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align:center; margin:14px 0;">
        <img src="/images/bakkerijproducten-netwerk.jpg" alt="Storage capacity" class="shadow-img" style="max-width:560px; width:100%; border-radius:2px;" />
      </div>

      <h5>PINSO HELPS YOU WITH THE PRACTICAL IMPLEMENTATION FOR AN EXPANSION OF YOUR STORAGE CAPACITY</h5>
      <p style="text-align:justify;">Rent or buy, difficult to define. It has to be determined based on several factors that become apparent after a thorough analysis of your business and your future position in the current market. Also presenting the most ideal construction after your decision is one of our tasks. Our experts have gained their experience within the departments of storage and handling at KATOEN NATIE.</p>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h5>PINSO BUILDS A NETWORK FOR THE DISTRIBUTION OF YOUR PRODUCTS IN THE BENELUX</h5>
      <img src="/images/bakkerijproducten-netwerk.jpg" alt="Bakery products network" class="shadow-img" style="float:left; margin:0 14px 10px 0; width:230px; height:170px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:2px;" />
      <p style="text-align:justify;">Each product requires a different approach. Through our years of global experience, our many contacts within the Benelux and our numerous contacts with international manufacturers of consumer goods and technology (BtoB) we can help you to set up your own chain of resellers in the Benelux. From the search for suitable locations, the practical implementation for the start of retail space to the recruitment of staff for administration and sales. We have extensive experience with international groups such as MON PETIT BATEAU, BONGARD, BECKER, GPG, PAVAILLER, DAUB and many others.</p>
      <div style="clear:both;"></div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h5>PINSO HELPS YOU TO SET UP A NEW COMPANY IN THE BENELUX</h5>
      <img src="/images/product-placement.jpg" alt="Product placement bakery" class="shadow-img" style="float:right; margin:0 0 10px 14px; width:230px; height:170px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:2px;" />
      <p style="text-align:justify;">Market research, identification of suitable location, founding the company, selecting and recruiting the appropriate staff, startup and supervision for transfer to the new management. Pinso guides you during the entire process through the use of external and internal specialists.</p>
      <div style="clear:both;"></div>
    </main>

    <Sidebar lang="en" activePage="organisation" side="left" showLogo={true} />
  </div>
</Layout>
